# Ideas: the tab, scrolled to its end, the rail idea hex found something on, its earlier checks,
# Start it and Undo, Stop looking, and a word added to it. The stand-in keeps every write from
# reaching hex.
launch /
tap hex-tab-ideas
shoot ideas
tap ideas-more
scroll home-list-ideas
shoot ideas-end
scroll-back home-list-ideas
tap idea-row-t-2
shoot idea
tap idea-earlier
shoot earlier
tap idea-start
shoot started
tap idea-start-undo
shoot undone
tap idea-look
shoot stopped
type idea-field Brass, not copper
shoot typed
tap idea-send
wait 1
shoot sent
